   "title": "8月2日(日)は「第32回 深谷花火大会」が開催されるよ。交通規制まとめ。",
   "html": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">2026年8月2日（日）<br>深谷市菅沼「川本地区複合施設 ワモア川本」周辺（荒川河川敷 ）で、『第32回深谷花火大会』が開催されます。</p>\n\n\n\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet\"><p lang=\"ja\" dir=\"ltr\">【第32回深谷花火大会】（商工振興課）『深谷花火大会』を8月2日（日）に開催します（雨天等の場合8月9日に順延）。<a href=\"https://x.com/hashtag/fukaya?src=hash&amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">#fukaya</a>,<a href=\"https://x.com/hashtag/%E6%B7%B1%E8%B0%B7%E8%8A%B1%E7%81%AB%E5%A4%A7%E4%BC%9A?src=hash&amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">#深谷花火大会</a>,<a href=\"https://x.com/hashtag/%E6%B8%8B%E6%B2%A2%E6%A0%84%E4%B8%80?src=hash&amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">#渋沢栄一</a>,<a href=\"https://x.com/hashtag/%E6%B7%B1%E8%B0%B7%E5%B8%82?src=hash&amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">#深谷市</a> <a href=\"https://t.co/kSfpUdgHn3\">pic.twitter.com/kSfpUdgHn3</a></p>&mdash; 深谷市 (@Fukaya_City) <a href=\"https://x.com/Fukaya_City/status/2082250656442982403?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">July 28, 2026</a></blockquote> <script async src=\"https://platform.x.com/widgets.js\" charset=\"utf-8\"></script>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"u-mb-ctrl u-mb-0 wp-block-paragraph\">【会場付近の地図】</p>\n\n\n\n<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3222.1185854150926!2d139.28628179999998!3d36.1393258!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x601ed7001e2e218b%3A0xe79ed1764b4213e2!2z44Ov44Oi44Ki5bed5pys!5e0!3m2!1sja!2sjp!4v1753748434229!5m2!1sja!2sjp\" width=\"728\" height=\"450\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"u-mb-ctrl u-mb-10 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-l\"><span class=\"swl-marker mark_yellow\">【交通規制略図】</span></span></strong></p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"1024\" src=\"http://sai2.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/759835091_18371287417232758_8266691144136692557_n-760x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-201208\" srcset=\"https://sai2.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/759835091_18371287417232758_8266691144136692557_n-760x1024.jpg 760w, https://sai2.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/759835091_18371287417232758_8266691144136692557_n-223x300.jpg 223w, https://sai2.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/759835091_18371287417232758_8266691144136692557_n-768x1034.jpg 768w, https://sai2.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/759835091_18371287417232758_8266691144136692557_n.jpg 868w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-xs\">＜出典：<a href=\"https://www.city.fukaya.saitama.jp/soshiki/sangyoshinko/shokoshinkou/tanto/ibento/16474.html\">深谷市</a>＞</span></figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"swell-block-button red_ -size-custom is-style-btn_normal u-mb-ctrl u-mb-40\" style=\"--the-width:100%\"><a href=\"http://www.fukaya-ta.com/news/27435/\" class=\"swell-block-button__link\"><span>「交通規制略図」はコチラ</span></a></div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-l\"><span class=\"swl-marker mark_yellow\">第32回 深谷花火大会プログラム</span></span></strong></p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-style-border\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"1024\" src=\"http://sai2.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/757921512_18371287411232758_9072658478148963636_n-760x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-201206\" srcset=\"https://sai2.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/757921512_18371287411232758_9072658478148963636_n-760x1024.jpg 760w, https://sai2.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/757921512_18371287411232758_9072658478148963636_n-223x300.jpg 223w, https://sai2.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/757921512_18371287411232758_9072658478148963636_n-768x1034.jpg 768w, https://sai2.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/757921512_18371287411232758_9072658478148963636_n-1141x1536.jpg 1141w, https://sai2.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/757921512_18371287411232758_9072658478148963636_n.jpg 1240w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-xs\">＜出典：<a href=\"https://fukaya-sci.net/\">ふかや市商工会</a>＞</span></figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"swell-block-button red_ -size-custom is-style-btn_normal\" style=\"--the-width:100%\"><a href=\"https://fukaya-sci.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/2ce34dfefcf76250812f75a79ef38dcf-scaled.jpg\" class=\"swell-block-button__link\"><span>第32回深谷花火大会プログラムはコチラ</span></a></div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">今回から有料観覧席を先着順で販売！お申し込みは<a href=\"https://www.ticketpay.jp/search/?keyword=%E6%B7%B1%E8%B0%B7%E8%8A%B1%E7%81%AB%E5%A4%A7%E4%BC%9A\">チケットペイ</a>から。<br>※予定枚数に達し次第、販売終了</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"swell-block-button green_ -size-custom is-style-btn_normal\" style=\"--the-width:100%\"><a href=\"https://www.ticketpay.jp/search/?keyword=%E6%B7%B1%E8%B0%B7%E8%8A%B1%E7%81%AB%E5%A4%A7%E4%BC%9A\" class=\"swell-block-button__link\"><span>「チケットペイ」はコチラ</span></a></div>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"761\" height=\"1024\" src=\"http://sai2.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/759611204_18371287393232758_8518203626434672775_n-761x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-201207\" srcset=\"https://sai2.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/759611204_18371287393232758_8518203626434672775_n-761x1024.jpg 761w, https://sai2.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/759611204_18371287393232758_8518203626434672775_n-223x300.jpg 223w, https://sai2.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/759611204_18371287393232758_8518203626434672775_n-768x1034.jpg 768w, https://sai2.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/759611204_18371287393232758_8518203626434672775_n.jpg 878w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 761px) 100vw, 761px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"is-style-stitch wp-block-paragraph\">深谷の夏の風物詩！<br><strong><span class=\"swl-inline-color has-swl-deep-04-color\">第32回深谷花火大会</span></strong><br>◆日時／2026年8月2日（日）午後7時～9時<br>※雨天等の場合、8月9日（日)に順延<br>◆開催場所／ワモア川本南 荒川河川敷<br>◆交通規制時間／午後５時～午後９時３０分まで<br>◆お問い合わせ／深谷花火大会実行委員会事務局<br>（電話：048-584-2325）※ふかや市商工会本所内<br>◆関連リンク／<br><a href=\"https://www.city.fukaya.saitama.jp/soshiki/sangyoshinko/shokoshinkou/tanto/ibento/16474.html\">深谷市</a>｜<a href=\"https://fukaya-sci.net/\">ふかや市商工会</a>｜<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/fukaya_impulse/\">Instagram</a></p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity is-style-wide\"/>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-xs\">※記事内の情報は2026年7月30日時点のものです。</span></p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity is-style-wide\"/>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n"
